            <p>Plot the points and connect them with a smooth curve to form a parabola opening upward with vertex at <m>(0, 3)</m>.</p>
            <figure>
                <caption>Graph of <m>y = x^2 + 3</m></caption>
                <image xml:id="fig-plot1-solution" width="60%">
                    <shortdescription>Parabola y = x^2 + 3</shortdescription>
                    <latex-image>
                        <![CDATA[
                        \begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.48]
